ckgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;startArrow=ERmany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=12;endSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_PRODUCT_INGREDIENT" target="t_INGREDIENT"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="map-149" value="" style="fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;startArrow=ERmany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=12;endSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_INGREDIENT_FUNCTION" target="t_INGREDIENT"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="map-150" value="" style="fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;startArrow=ERmany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=12;endSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_INGREDIENT_FLAG" target="t_INGREDIENT"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="rnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Mapping rules applied&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Each strong entity becomes a table; its key becomes the primary key.&lt;br&gt;2. Composite attributes (full_name, skin_profile) are flattened into simple columns.&lt;br&gt;3. Derived attributes (age_range, total_duration, safety_score, overall_confidence, rank) are computed, not stored.&lt;br&gt;4. 1:N relationships: foreign key on the N side (e.g. SKIN_ANALYSIS.user_id).&lt;br&gt;5. M:N relationships become junction tables that carry the relationship attributes (ZONE_ASSESSMENT, PREDICTION, PRODUCT_USE, PRODUCT_INGREDIENT); ANSWER holds one row per selected option (multivalued relationship attribute), so a skipped question has no row.&lt;br&gt;6. Multivalued attributes become their own tables (QUESTION_OPTION, INGREDIENT_FUNCTION, INGREDIENT_FLAG).&lt;br&gt;7. Weak entity ROUTINE_STEP: primary key = owner key routine_id + partial key step_no.&lt;br&gt;8. Specialization of PHOTO (disjoint, total): one table per class; each subclass reuses the superclass key (photo_id is both PK and FK) and photo_kind records the subclass.&lt;br&gt;9. 1:1 DOCUMENTS: unique foreign key PROGRESS_PHOTO.log_id.&lt;br&gt;10. Optional 1:N BASED_ON: own table ROUTINE_SOURCE (no NULL, no dependency analysis_id → user_id inside ROUTINE).&lt;br&gt;All 26 tables are in Boyce-Codd normal form (BCNF)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1960" y="3920" width="1120" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_rel_1" value="T1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1307" y="3093" width="46" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_rel_2" value="T2" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="927" y="3093" width="46" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_rel_3" value="T3" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="927" y="3273" width="46" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_rel_4" value="T4" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="547" y="3253" wid